  "bookId": "activity-extra-miku",
  "id": "source-16590",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "16590001",
          "sourceType": 10,
          "text": "寻找象征「春天」的声音♫",
          "title": "小节引文",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "和江和江，快来看窗户外面！\n天上在下粉色的雨呢，粉色的花瓣雨喔~！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "……那不是粉色的雨，优纪。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "啊，那是什么呀？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "那是窗外的一棵樱花树随风飘落的花瓣。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "不知不觉之间，又到了繁花盛开的春天呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "原来这就是春天的样子啊……春天真的好美呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "以前就很好奇为什么春天会是主人|101|最爱的季节，这下优纪全都明·白·啦~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "呐呐，和江，我们一起给主人准备一份只属于春天的礼物好不好~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "只属于春天的礼物……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "优纪有什么好想法么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嘿嘿，优纪想要给主人|101|收集能够代表春天的声音~！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "这个主意很……有优纪的风格。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "走吧，我们一起到外面寻找与春天有关的声音。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "哟吼，出发收集春天的声音咯~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590016",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "铃♪……铃铃♫♪……♫♬♪",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这是什么声音，有点特别呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "是春天的暖风吹过风铃的声音。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嗯嗯，听起来很动人，不过……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这个还不能当作送给主人|101|的声音~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "为什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "春天的风铃声音难道不够动人么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "风铃的声音是很好听，可是可是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "夏天，秋天和冬天，其他的季节也会有风铃的声音。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "所以呢，风铃声不能代表春天的声音啦~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "似乎有点道理。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "既然如此，我们再四处找找看。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "16590029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嗯嗯，优纪一定要找到能够代表「春天」的声音~！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
